; ============================================================================
; BSYS_OnCellEnterUDE
; ============================================================================
; Fires on suite entry and settles, so the safe is current before the player
; can reach it - not frozen: the sim keeps running on whatever's left until
; Benny is dead or gone.
; ============================================================================

Create: BSYS_OnCellEnterUDE

ref rCell

Begin Function { rCell }
  Call BSYS_EndCheckUDF
End
